sequenceDiagram
participant C as Creditor
participant CA as Creditor Agent
participant CS as Clearing and Settlement Agent
participant DA as Debtor Agent
participant D as Debtor
C->>CA: CustomerDirectDebitInitiation
CA->>C: CustomerPaymentStatusReport
CA->>CS: FIToFICustomerDirectDebit
CS->>CA: FIToFIPaymentStatusReport
CS->>DA: FIToFICustomerDirectDebit
DA->>CS: FIToFIPaymentStatusReport
Note over C: Start of the reversal, for example, in the case of a duplicated direct debit instruction
C->>CA: CustomerPaymentReversal
CA->>C: CustomerPaymentStatusReport
CA->>CS: FIToFIPaymentReversal
CS->>CA: FIToFIPaymentStatusReport
CS->>DA: FIToFIPaymentReversal
DA->>CS: FIToFIPaymentStatusReport
